   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fixed here: role injection at sign-up · login\n$or matching the wrong user · email\nenumeration · reset link pointed at the API ·\nreset tokens expired an hour after server\nstart (Date.now() at load) · no forgot /\nreset pages · not signed in after registering",
   "originalText": "Fixed here: role injection at sign-up · login\n$or matching the wrong user · email\nenumeration · reset link pointed at the API ·\nreset tokens expired an hour after server\nstart (Date.now() at load) · no forgot /\nreset pages · not signed in after registering",
