  {
   "id": "tex-0247",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1634,
   "y": 2820.0,
   "width": 792,
   "height": 170.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1210249371,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 918853528,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1761264000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rules (enforced on the server)\n• Customers cancel their own order while PENDING or CONFIRMED (PUT /orders/:id/cancel)\n• Admins can set any status, including CANCELLED from SHIPPED\n• DELIVERED and CANCELLED can't change any more\n• Cancel uses a conditional update, so a double click can't restock twice\n• DELETE /orders/:id (admin) restocks unless delivered\n• Merchants see the status read-only\n• Unpaid online orders keep stock reserved — add an expiry job (report §10)",
   "originalText": "Rules (enforced on the server)\n• Customers cancel their own order while PENDING or CONFIRMED (PUT /orders/:id/cancel)\n• Admins can set any status, including CANCELLED from SHIPPED\n• DELIVERED and CANCELLED can't change any more\n• Cancel uses a conditional update, so a double click can't restock twice\n• DELETE /orders/:id (admin) restocks unless delivered\n• Merchants see the status read-only\n• Unpaid online orders keep stock reserved — add an expiry job (report §10)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec-0246",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
