   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1761264000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ADMIN · Admin console\n• Everything a merchant can do, for every product\n• All orders: change status, delete (restocks)\n• Users: create, change roles, activate / deactivate, delete\n• Can't deactivate, delete or demote themselves (\"You\" tag)\n• Stats tiles double as filters · \"Needs attention\" deep links\n• API: GET /orders · GET /users, /users/stats, /users/count · PATCH /users/:id/roles · PUT /orders/:id/status",
   "originalText": "ADMIN · Admin console\n• Everything a merchant can do, for every product\n• All orders: change status, delete (restocks)\n• Users: create, change roles, activate / deactivate, delete\n• Can't deactivate, delete or demote themselves (\"You\" tag)\n• Stats tiles double as filters · \"Needs attention\" deep links\n• API: GET /orders · GET /users, /users/stats, /users/count · PATCH /users/:id/roles · PUT /orders/:id/status",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec-0269",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
